  "description": "Description of proposed development / works including change of use:\nChange of use of the existing single dwellinghouse from Use Class C3 to Use Class C2 in order to provide small-scale residential assessment and supported accommodation for one mother and her child. The proposal relates to a single-placement model within a normal domestic property, supported by two support workers operating on a 24-hour rota basis and oversight from a non-resident Ofsted-registered manager.\n\nThe use is intended to provide a safe, structured, and closely supervised home environment for assessment and support, while remaining domestic in scale and character. The property will continue to operate as a residential home, with no subdivision into separate units and no intensification comparable to a larger institutional care setting.\n\nNo external alterations, extensions, or significant internal structural works are proposed. The building will retain its existing residential appearance, form, and layout, and there will be no changes that materially affect the visual character of the property or the surrounding area.",
